# The build context is the repository root; the image's stages read workers/ (the bundle stage installs and bundles
# it, the final stage copies relay-kit's built page) and bundle.mjs, nothing else.
*
!workers
!deploy/relay/image/bundle.mjs
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/dist
**/target
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/.env
**/.dev.vars
**/secrets
**/credentials.json*
